    "detailed_description": "<strong>This animated visual novel is about a young 10-year-old who wanders into a world ruled by dogs, cats, warlocks, and spirits in search of their missing puppy. Your job is to navigate through this mysterious world, looking for the lost pup, so that you both can venture back home together.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273350/extras/992cac0523167314e675a4c067bf208f.avif?t=1627934801\" /></div><br><strong>You will play as the boy character:<br>(Other genders will be available for full game release. )</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273350/extras/6b4fb5947beb20cf9c4c46a89a83ddec.poster.avif?t=1627934801\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273350/extras/6b4fb5947beb20cf9c4c46a89a83ddec.webm?t=1627934801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><strong>All characters are voice acted except the character you play. We feel like this helps make the player feel immersed in the story. <br>Other characters you'll encounter throughout are:</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273350/extras/d3862241554958ee0b0c558cf7bfa374.poster.avif?t=1627934801\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273350/extras/d3862241554958ee0b0c558cf7bfa374.webm?t=1627934801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><strong>We hope you enjoy the game. As you can tell from the Mini Map we have lot of fun places for you to explore once the game is completed.  Thank you very much.</strong>",
